Files in this repository that come with their own license are under that license
instead (for example models or sounds from outside the Game, whose licenses are kept
next to them).

In short:
  - Read the code, build the Game and play it yourself: yes.
  - Sell it, make money from it, or use it in anything commercial: no.
  - Share, reupload or release it, changed or not, even for free: no.
  - Use its code, art, story or characters in anything else: no, not without written
